From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Phil Reif <pr@sambal.net>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 21:00:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(frontend): add the Nachtgold colour scheme

Add a navy surface tone, a gold accent, and a Nachtgold preset in App
Preferences that sets the dark theme, the gold accent, and the navy tone
for both themes in one step.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
